fastrdp-xrdp (0.10.6.1+xorgxrdp0.10.5-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Site configuration (xrdp.ini, sesman.ini, gfx.toml, startwm.sh,
    /etc/X11/xrdp/xorg.conf, /etc/pam.d/xrdp-sesman) is no longer shipped as
    conffiles: fastrdp replaces these files, so dpkg asked on upgrades.
    Upstream's versions are in /usr/share/fastrdp-xrdp/default-config/;
    postinst copies them only where a file is missing, purge removes them.

 -- Marcel Ritter <marcel@linux-ng.de>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

